Package: ndopred
Title: Automated IUCN Red List Assessment for NDOP Data
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jonáš", "Gaigr", , "jonas.gaigr@aopk.gov.cz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Proposes national IUCN Red List categories for the Czech
    Republic from occurrence data in the NDOP database. One rule engine
    evaluates criteria A to E with three-valued logic (TRUE, FALSE,
    UNKNOWN), separating data measured from the records, indications derived
    from them, and evidence supplied by the assessor. Each proposal comes
    with the criteria behind it (also in IUCN Annex 2 notation), whether it
    is evidenced or rests on indications, what still needs evidence, and a
    plausible range of categories. Thresholds follow the IUCN Red List
    Categories and Criteria v3.1 (2012), interpreted by the Guidelines for
    Using the IUCN Red List Categories and Criteria v16 (2024). Includes
    Shiny dashboards for bulk screening and for expert assessment.
